        <li>Use the service for personal and lawful purposes.</li>
        <li>Do not try to disrupt it, bypass its protections or query it automatically other than through the API provided for that purpose.</li>
        <li>Keep your API tokens secret and revoke at once, from your settings, any token you believe compromised. Actions taken with a token are deemed taken by you.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>6. Liability</h2>
    <p>TDUTRION SOLUTIONS takes reasonable measures to keep the service available and working, without any guarantee of permanent availability: it may be interrupted, in particular for maintenance. TDUTRION SOLUTIONS cannot be held liable for a missed showtime, a schedule change, or the terms of sale of Pathé.</p>

    <h2>7. Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>The service and its content are protected, as described in the <a href="{{ path('app_legal_notice') }}">legal notice</a>.</p>

    <h2>8. Personal data</h2>
