    <h2>9. Ending the use of the service</h2>
    <p>You may stop using the service at any time and ask for your account to be deleted at <a href="mailto:hello@tdutrion.fr">hello@tdutrion.fr</a>. If these terms are breached, TDUTRION SOLUTIONS may suspend or delete an account.</p>

